{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You are a Remonstrator. The freedom of this world depends on you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191140/extras/Preview_Capitol.png?t=1742851561\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fights with crowds of police</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">...Side by side with a crowd of the same people dissatisfied with the system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Realistic combat system in the Beat'Em Up genre with police batons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unrealistic ragdoll physics of enemies flying away from your menace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extremely realistic physics of desecration of city streets with impurities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Locations taken from real places and events... well, or not quite</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ranks and style points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soundtrack based on popular songs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3191140/extras/gameplay.gif?t=1742851561\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Russian revolution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Moscow, Bolotnaya Square, 2011</u></strong>: a crowd of aggressively-minded Muscovites rebelled against the regime. Take part in a mass brawl with the police and defeat the commander of the defense detachment with the call sign &quot;Bryansk-North&quot;!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Battle for the Capitol</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Washington, Capitol, 2020</strong></u>: Americans dissatisfied with the government have laid siege to the main government building. Break through the police fortifications and defeat Lieutenant Covfefe to get t